[2025-09-02 02:29:30] Received hook input: {"session_id":"a9353296-ca6e-414e-9911-2ed75f7ed6b2","transcript_path":"/home/liahua/.claude/projects/-home-liahua-IdeaProject-qq-bot/a9353296-ca6e-414e-9911-2ed75f7ed6b2.jsonl","cwd":"/home/liahua/IdeaProject/qq_bot","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/home/liahua/IdeaProject/qq_bot/doing/SE-Performance-Monitoring-Recommendations.md","content":"# SE性能监控建议书\n**制定者**: Claude Code SE  \n**目标系统**: QQ Bot with Session Management  \n**制定日期**: 2025-09-01\n\n## 🎯 性能监控战略\n\n### 当前性能基线\n```\n系统启动时间: ~2秒 (优秀)\n数据库连接时间: ~30ms (良好)\nWebSocket连接时间: ~10ms (优秀)  \nHTTP API响应时间: <100ms (良好)\n内存占用: 正常范围\nToken管理: LRU策略运行正常\n```\n\n### 关键性能指标 (KPI)\n\n#### 1. Session管理性能\n```typescript\n// 建议监控的Session相关指标\nSession创建平均响应时间: < 50ms\nSession查询平均响应时间: < 30ms  \nSession链追溯平均时间: < 100ms\n并发Session处理能力: > 1000 sessions/min\nSession内存泄漏监控: 0 leaks\n```\n\n#### 2. 数据库性能\n```sql\n-- 关键查询性能监控\nSELECT 'conversation_sessions查询' as metric, \n       AVG(query_time) as avg_time_ms\nFROM performance_schema.events_statements_history_long \nWHERE sql_text LIKE '%conversation_sessions%';\n\n-- 建议添加的索引监控\nSHOW INDEX FROM conversation_sessions;\nSHOW INDEX FROM message_reply_chain;\n```\n\n#### 3. AI服务性能\n```\nToken轮换延迟: < 10ms\nGemini API调用成功率: > 99%\nAPI响应时间: < 2000ms (P95)\nToken黑名单命中率: < 5%\n```\n\n## 🔧 性能监控实现建议\n\n### 1. 应用级监控\n```typescript\n// src/utils/performance-monitor.ts\nexport class PerformanceMonitor {\n  private metrics = new Map<string, number[]>();\n  \n  startTiming(operation: string): () => void {\n    const start = performance.now();\n    return () => {\n      const duration = performance.now() - start;\n      this.recordMetric(operation, duration);\n      \n      // 如果响应时间异常，记录告警\n      if (duration > this.getThreshold(operation)) {\n        this.alertSlowOperation(operation, duration);\n      }\n    };\n  }\n  \n  private getThreshold(operation: string): number {\n    const thresholds = {\n      'session_create': 50,\n      'session_query': 30,\n      'session_chain_trace': 100,\n      'ai_response_generate': 2000\n    };\n    return thresholds[operation] || 1000;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Session性能监控集成\n```typescript\n// 在SessionManager中集成性能监控\nexport class SessionManager extends EventEmitter {\n  private perfMonitor = new PerformanceMonitor();\n  \n  async processIncomingMessage(message: QQMessage): Promise<SessionContext> {\n    const endTiming = this.perfMonitor.startTiming('session_process');\n    \n    try {\n      // 现有逻辑...\n      const result = await this.createOrGetSession(message);\n      \n      // 记录Session相关指标\n      this.perfMonitor.recordMetric('active_sessions', this.getActiveSessionCount());\n      \n      return result;\n    } finally {\n      endTiming();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 数据库监控增强\n```typescript\n// src/services/database.ts 中添加性能监控\nexport class DatabaseManager {\n  async executeQuery<T>(query: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T[]> {\n    const endTiming = this.perfMonitor.startTiming('db_query');\n    const queryStart = Date.now();\n    \n    try {\n      const result = await this.pool.query(query, params);\n      \n      // 记录慢查询\n      const queryTime = Date.now() - queryStart;\n      if (queryTime > 100) {\n        this.logger.warn('Slow query detected', {\n          query: query.substring(0, 100),\n          queryTime,\n          params: params?.length\n        });\n      }\n      \n      return result[0] as T[];\n    } finally {\n      endTiming();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 实时监控Dashboard\n```html\n<!-- public/monitoring-dashboard.html -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <title>QQ Bot Performance Monitor</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"monitoring-grid\">\n        <div class=\"metric-card\">\n            <h3>Session Performance</h3>\n            <canvas id=\"sessionMetrics\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"metric-card\">\n            <h3>Database Performance</h3>\n            <canvas id=\"dbMetrics\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"metric-card\">\n            <h3>AI Service Performance</h3>\n            <canvas id=\"aiMetrics\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <script>\n        // 实时性能数据获取和展示\n        async function fetchPerformanceMetrics() {\n            const response = await fetch('/api/performance/metrics');\n            const data = await response.json();\n            updateCharts(data);\n        }\n        \n        setInterval(fetchPerformanceMetrics, 5000); // 每5秒更新\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n## 📊 性能基准测试建议\n\n### 1. 负载测试脚本\n```javascript\n// tests/performance/session-load-test.js\nconst { performance } = require('perf_hooks');\n\ndescribe('Session Performance Tests', () => {\n  test('should handle 1000 concurrent session creations', async () => {\n    const promises = Array.from({ length: 1000 }, (_, i) => \n      createSessionConcurrently(i)\n    );\n    \n    const start = performance.now();\n    await Promise.all(promises);\n    const end = performance.now();\n    \n    expect(end - start).toBeLessThan(10000); // 10秒内完成\n  });\n  \n  test('session query response time benchmark', async () => {\n    const times = [];\n    \n    for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n      const start = performance.now();\n      await sessionManager.getSessionById(`session_test_${i}`);\n      const end = performance.now();\n      times.push(end - start);\n    }\n    \n    const avgTime = times.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / times.length;\n    expect(avgTime).toBeLessThan(50); // 平均50ms以内\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 内存泄漏检测\n```typescript\n// tests/performance/memory-leak-test.ts\ndescribe('Memory Leak Tests', () => {\n  test('should not leak memory after session cleanup', async () => {\n    const initialMemory = process.memoryUsage().heapUsed;\n    \n    // 创建大量Session\n    for (let i = 0; i < 10000; i++) {\n      await sessionManager.createSession(`test_${i}`);\n    }\n    \n    // 清理Session\n    await sessionManager.cleanupExpiredSessions();\n    \n    // 强制垃圾回收\n    global.gc?.();\n    \n    const finalMemory = process.memoryUsage().heapUsed;\n    const memoryIncrease = finalMemory - initialMemory;\n    \n    // 内存增长应该在合理范围内\n    expect(memoryIncrease).toBeLessThan(50 * 1024 * 1024); // 50MB\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## 🚨 性能告警规则\n\n### 临界值设置\n```yaml\n# 性能告警配置\nalerts:\n  session_creation_time:\n    threshold: 100ms\n    severity: warning\n    \n  session_query_time:\n    threshold: 80ms  \n    severity: warning\n    \n  db_connection_pool_usage:\n    threshold: 80%\n    severity: critical\n    \n  memory_usage:\n    threshold: 1GB\n    severity: warning\n    \n  ai_api_error_rate:\n    threshold: 10%\n    severity: critical\n```\n\n### 告警通知实现\n```typescript\n// src/utils/alerting.ts\nexport class AlertingService {\n  async sendAlert(metric: string, value: number, threshold: number) {\n    const alert = {\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      metric,\n      value,\n      threshold,\n      severity: this.getSeverity(metric, value, threshold)\n    };\n    \n    // 发送到监控系统或通知渠道\n    await this.notifyOpsTeam(alert);\n    \n    // 记录到数据库\n    await this.saveAlertToDb(alert);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 📈 性能优化建议\n\n### 短期优化 (1-2周)\n1. **数据库查询优化**\n   - 为session_id添加索引\n   - 优化复杂的JOIN查询\n   - 实现查询结果缓存\n\n2. **Session管理优化**\n   - 实现Session池化\n   - 添加Session预创建机制\n   - 优化Session过期清理策略\n\n### 中期优化 (1-2个月)\n1. **缓存层引入**\n   - Redis缓存热点Session数据\n   - 实现分布式Session共享\n   - 添加查询结果缓存\n\n2. **异步处理优化**\n   - 异步Session创建\n   - 批量数据库操作\n   - 事件驱动的Session更新\n\n### 长期优化 (3-6个月)\n1. **架构级优化**\n   - 微服务拆分Session管理\n   - 读写分离数据库架构\n   - 消息队列解耦处理\n\n2. **可扩展性提升**\n   - 水平扩展支持\n   - 负载均衡策略\n   - 多地域部署支持\n\n---\n\n**SE建议**: 优先实现基础的性能监控，建立基线指标，然后逐步完善告警和优化机制。\n\n**下次Review**: 2025-09-02 (验证基础监控实现)"},"tool_response":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/liahua/IdeaProject/qq_bot/doing/SE-Performance-Mon